WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.301
-Good evening. I'm Seth Myers.

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.004
This is late night we hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.905
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:09.509
In the wake of Russian President
Vladimir Putin's invasion

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.378
of Ukraine, President Biden
today announced the full scope

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.048
of sanctions against Russia,
including blocks

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.117
on Russian banks that hold
$1 trillion in assets

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:21.320
and their ability to do
business in dollars, euros,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.855
pounds and the yen.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:25.424
Which explains why Russia just
tried to buy a fighter jet

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.093
with a picture of a bored ape.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.729
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:33.232
[ Russian accent ]
Is good for one jet, no?

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.768
[ Normal voice ] Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.470
declared war last night against
Ukraine, and this is nice,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.674
Trump offered to host
the after-party.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.442
That's right,
Vladimir Putin declared war

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:45.578
last night against Ukraine
but said that Russia

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.713
has no plans to, "occupy."

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:51.216
Oh, buddy,
nobody has plans to occupy.

00:00:51.216 --> 00:00:53.486
We all remember when our war
in Iraq was supposed to

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.987
be a three-day weekend.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:57.424
You're like that guy who thinks
he is going to have one drink

00:00:57.424 --> 00:01:00.526
with his old college friends --
No!

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:03.062
You're going to wake up at dawn
in a karaoke booth

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.664
with your socks on your hands
saying,

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:09.102
"Oh, man, did I do islands in
the stream with sock puppets?"

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.570
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.339
After President Biden imposed
an initial round of sanctions

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.342
against Russia, the Russian
Foreign Affairs Ministry warned,

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.878
"There should be no doubt that
sanctions will receive

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.414
a strong response." Come on.
You think you can attack us?

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:26.485
This is America.
We attack ourselves.

00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:29.655
We good.

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:32.191
Following last night's Russian
invasion of Ukraine,

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:35.328
the price of oil has jumped to
above $100 a barrel,

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:37.931
for the first time since 2014.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.199
And I'm the second person to
tell you that

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:45.071
if your friend has a Tesla.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.573
According to new study,
the erectile dysfunction drug

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.843
Viagra can be used as a new
treatment for dogs

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:51.443
with a rare eating disorder.

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:53.346
Though it's not going to help
with the embarrassment

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.280
at the pharmacy.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.750
It's for my dog!

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.520
An eating disorder.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:07.193
Well, it's rare. So you wouldn't
have heard of it.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.695
And finally actor
Leonardo DiCaprio announced

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.798
this week that he has made a
significant investment

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.832
in a 110-year-old
champagne house.

00:02:13.832 --> 00:02:15.167
Not his first choice.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:18.170
But it's hard to find a
24-year-old champagne house.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.139
[ Laughter ]
You get it.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.175
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:23.576
[ Cheers and applause ]
That was the monologue.

